<p>Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>

<p>Someone requested a password reset for your account. If this was you, click the link below to choose a new password. This link expires in 15 minutes.</p>

<%= mail_button "Reset your password", @url %>
<%= mail_fallback_link @url %>

<p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
